          "id": "cex-cm-collinear-labeling-admits-a-nontrivial-rotation",
          "kind": "counterexample",
          "domain": "mathematics",
          "title": "A collinear labeling admits a nontrivial rotation",
          "statement": "Every nonempty labeling $S\\subseteq\\mathbb R^3$ determines the rotation: if $R\\in SO(3)$ satisfies $Rs=s$ for every $s\\in S$, then $R=I_3$.",
