            "def-ck-and-multi-index-notation-in-several-variables": "mathematical-premise",
            "def-jacobian-matrix-and-gradient": "mathematical-premise",
            "def-directional-and-partial-derivatives": "mathematical-premise",
            "def-regular-critical-points-values-and-level-sets": "mathematical-premise",
            "def-tangent-space-to-a-regular-level-set": "mathematical-premise"
          },
          "inventory_expansion_required": false,
          "statement": "Let $O\\subseteq\\mathbb R^3$ be open and nonempty, and consider the derivations\n$A:=\\partial_x$ and $B:=\\partial_y+x\\,\\partial_z$ acting on $C^2$ functions on $O$. If\n$G:O\\to\\mathbb R$ is of class $C^2$ with\n\n$$AG=0\\quad\\text{and}\\quad BG=0\\quad\\text{on }O,$$\n\nthen $DG=0$ on $O$. Consequently, if $G:O\\to\\mathbb R$ is $C^2$ and $DG(q)\\ne0$ for every\n$q\\in O$ (so that every level set of $G$ is a regular level set with tangent space\n$\\ker DG(q)$, [[def-regular-critical-points-values-and-level-sets]],\n[[def-tangent-space-to-a-regular-level-set]]), then the distribution\n$D(q)=\\operatorname{span}\\{A(q),B(q)\\}$ of [[def-cm-nonholonomic-velocity-constraint-law]] cannot equal $\\ker DG(q)$ for every $q\\in O$; that is, no such $G$ has level sets whose tangent planes are everywhere the\nvirtual displacements of the constraint $z'=xy'$.",
          "strategy": "Compute the bracket [A,B] and evaluate it against G; the bracket is not in the span, so no regular level set can be tangent to the distribution.",
          "provenance": {
            "statement": "ai-altered",
            "proof": "ai-altered"
          },
          "sources": {
            "references": [
              {
                "title": "J. Cortes, M. de Leon, D. Martin de Diego and S. Martinez, Geometric description of vakonomic and nonholonomic dynamics. Comparison of solutions (SIAM J. Control Optim., author PDF), Section 5 (Chetaev equations for non-integrable linear constraints and the non-integrability discussion)",
                "url": "http://terrano.ucsd.edu/jorge/publications/data/2003_CoLeMaMa-sicon.pdf"
              },
