            ]
          },
          "statement": "Let $(I,\\theta)$ be period-one action-angle coordinates with\n$\\omega=\\sum_{i=1}^n d\\theta_i\\wedge dI_i$ as supplied by\n[[thm-cm-liouville-arnold-action-angle-repaired]] and\n[[def-action-and-angle-coordinates]]. Use the quotient lift charts and global angle differentials specified in [[thm-cm-liouville-arnold-action-angle-repaired]]. Put $T_{\\mathrm{rad}}:=\\mathbb R/(2\\pi\\mathbb Z)$, with quotient lift charts from intervals of length less than $2\\pi$; their transitions are translations by $2\\pi k$, $k\\in\\mathbb Z$. The induced diffeomorphism $s:\\mathbb R/\\mathbb Z\\to T_{\\mathrm{rad}}$ is $s([x])=[2\\pi x]$, with inverse $[y]\\mapsto[y/(2\\pi)]$. Thus the notation $2\\pi\\theta_i$ below means $s\\circ\\theta_i$, with values in $T_{\\mathrm{rad}}$, and its differential is defined by local real lifts. The action domain rescales from $A$ to $A/(2\\pi)$. Define the rescaled coordinates\n\n$$\\theta_i^{\\mathrm{rad}}:=2\\pi\\,\\theta_i,\\qquad I_i^{\\mathrm{rad}}:=\\frac{I_i}{2\\pi}\\qquad(i=1,\\dots,n).$$\n\nThen $(\\theta^{\\mathrm{rad}},I^{\\mathrm{rad}})$ are $C^\\infty$ coordinates on the same chart,\n\n$$\\omega=\\sum_{i=1}^n d\\theta_i^{\\mathrm{rad}}\\wedge dI_i^{\\mathrm{rad}},$$\n\nthe angles $\\theta^{\\mathrm{rad}}$ are $2\\pi$-periodic (radian-valued), and if a Hamiltonian is\n$H=h(I)$ with $h$ of class $C^2$ in the period-one coordinates then in the radian coordinates it is\n$H=\\tilde h(I^{\\mathrm{rad}})$ with $\\tilde h(I^{\\mathrm{rad}})=h(2\\pi I^{\\mathrm{rad}})$ and\n$\\dot\\theta^{\\mathrm{rad}}_i=\\partial\\tilde h/\\partial I^{\\mathrm{rad}}_i$."
        },
        {
          "id": "rem-cm-scope-of-complete-integrability-and-action-angle",
          "kind": "remark",
          "domain": "mathematics",
          "title": "Scope of the action-angle and complete-integrability items: hypotheses, choice, singular and noncompact fibres, and the published proof gap",
          "reference": "expansion-proofs.md#e18",
          "design_state": "completed local argument; carrier and readiness record authored in this batch",
          "dependency_level": 5,
          "deps": [
