          "statement": "Let $J\\subseteq\\mathbb R$ be a nonempty open interval ([[def-interval]]), let $u:J\\to\\mathbb R$ be of class $C^4$ ([[def-ck-euclidean-maps-and-diffeomorphisms]]), let $x\\in J$ and $a>0$ satisfy $[x-a,x+a]\\subseteq J$, and put\n\n$$M:=\\sup_{s\\in[x-a,x+a]}|u''''(s)|<+\\infty .$$\n\nThen\n\n$$\\left|\\frac{u(x+a)-2u(x)+u(x-a)}{a^2}-u''(x)\\right|\\le\\frac{M\\,a^2}{12}.$$",
