          "kind": "lemma",
          "domain": "mathematics",
          "title": "Repeated integration by parts gives $|b_n(F)|\\le 2L^5M_5/(\\pi^5n^5)$ for odd $2L$-periodic $C^5$ functions and $|b_n(G)|\\le 2L^4M_4/(\\pi^4n^4)$ for $C^4$",
