          "inventory_expansion_required": false,
          "statement": "Let $L>0$. Let $F:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$ be odd and $2L$-periodic of class $C^5$ and let $G:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$ be odd and $2L$-periodic of class $C^4$ ([[def-cm-sine-coefficients-of-periodic-functions]], [[def-ck-euclidean-maps-and-diffeomorphisms]]); put\n\n$$M_5:=\\sup_{\\mathbb R}|F^{(5)}|<+\\infty,\\qquad M_4:=\\sup_{\\mathbb R}|G^{(4)}|<+\\infty .$$\n\nThen for every integer $n\\ge1$, with the sine coefficients $b_n$ of [[def-cm-sine-coefficients-of-periodic-functions]],\n\n$$|b_n(F)|\\le\\frac{2L^5M_5}{\\pi^5n^5},\\qquad |b_n(G)|\\le\\frac{2L^4M_4}{\\pi^4n^4}.$$",
          "strategy": "direct",
