          "inventory_expansion_required": false,
          "statement": "Take $\\lambda=2$, $\\mu=1$, $\\rho_0=1$ ([[def-cm-linear-elastic-constitutive-law]]: here $\\lambda+\\frac{2\\mu}{3}=\\frac83>0$). Let $k=(\\pi,0,0)$, $a=(1,0,0)$ and\n\n$$\\xi(t,x)=a\\cos(\\pi x_1-\\omega t),\\qquad \\omega:=2\\pi .$$\n\nThen $\\xi$ is a longitudinal plane wave with speed $\\sqrt{(\\lambda+2\\mu)/\\rho_0}=2$, and the associated strain and stress satisfy the elastic momentum identity; the strain energy density at time $t$ equals both $W(e)=2\\pi^2\\sin^2(\\pi x_1-\\omega t)$ and the decomposition $\\mu|e_0|_F^2+(\\lambda/2+\\mu/3)(\\operatorname{tr}e)^2$ with the same value.",
          "strategy": "direct",
          "provenance": {
            "statement": "ai-generated",
            "proof": "ai-generated"
          },
          "sources": {
            "references": [
