          "inventory_expansion_required": false,
          "statement": "Take $N=4$, $a=1$, $c=1$ in the cyclic chain of [[def-cm-cyclic-spring-chain]]. The wave number $\\kappa=\\pi/2$ gives\n\n$$\\omega^2=\\frac{4c^2}{a^2}\\sin^2\\Bigl(\\frac{\\kappa a}{2}\\Bigr)=4\\sin^2\\Bigl(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\Bigr)=2,\\qquad \\omega=\\sqrt2,$$\n\nand the profile $q_j(t)=\\cos\\bigl(\\frac{\\pi j}{2}-\\sqrt2\\,t\\bigr)$, $j\\in\\mathbb Z/4$, solves the chain equation exactly; the continuum comparison at this wave number gives the exact error $|\\omega^2-c^2\\kappa^2|=\\frac{\\pi^2}{4}-2$ against the exact bound $\\frac{c^2\\kappa^4a^2}{12}=\\frac{\\pi^4}{192}$.",
          "strategy": "direct",
          "provenance": {
