        {
          "id": "ex-cm-euler-angle-and-heavy-top-checks",
          "kind": "example",
          "domain": "mathematics",
          "title": "Finite checks of the Euler-angle parametrization, the angular-velocity formula and a steady precession of the heavy top",
          "statement": "All data are the exact ones of the heavy-top system of [[def-cm-euler-angle-parametrization-and-heavy-top-system]] with the parameter choice $A=C=m=d=g=1$, and the rotation matrices are those of [[lem-cm-coordinate-rotation-matrices]]. Three computations are performed: the value of the Euler-angle parametrization at a specific triple, the body angular velocity of a specific motion through the formula of [[lem-cm-euler-angle-angular-velocity]] checked against the definition, and a constant-rate precession checked against every clause of [[thm-cm-heavy-top-reduction]]. No physical measurement is involved and no claim about a physical top is made.",
