          "reference": "analytic-backward-error.md#e29",
          "design_state": "Fully authored draft; outside artifact completion cycle 1; independent native review remains pending",
          "statement": "Let $d\\ge1$, let $(U,U_\\rho,\\tilde A,\\tilde B,M,K,\\delta,\\Psi_h)$ be analytic splitting data with $\\tilde H:=\\tilde A+\\tilde B$, and let $X_j$, $j\\ge1$, be the coefficient fields of [[def-cm-modified-log-coefficients-and-truncations]] (independent of the truncation order by [[lem-cm-truncated-log-coefficient-bounds]] clause 4), with the bound $\\max_i\\lvert(X_j)_i\\rvert\\le\\beta_j:=\\frac{8M}{3}\\bigl(\\frac{C_0Mj}{\\rho}\\bigr)^{j-1}$ of that lemma on the common retained domain $E:=D(\\rho/4)$. In this item $D_j$ denotes $E$ for every $j\\ge1$, including $j=1$, whose coefficient is extracted using any order $N\\ge2$. Write $X_j=\\sum_{k=1}^d u^{(j)}_k\\partial_{z^k}+\\sum_{k=1}^d v^{(j)}_k\\partial_{w_k}$ in the coordinates $Z=(z,w)$ of [[def-cm-complex-phase-domains-and-holomorphic-maps]], and let $A_j:=\\bigl(\\partial_{Z_l}(X_j)_k\\bigr)_{k,l}$ be its complex Jacobian. Then for every $j\\ge1$:\n\n1. $X_j$ is a holomorphic vector field on $D_j$: all $u^{(j)}_k,v^{(j)}_k$ are holomorphic on $D_j$ and real-valued on $D_j\\cap\\mathbb R^{2d}$.\n2. $A_jJ+JA_j^{\\mathsf T}=0$ on $D_j$; equivalently, the contraction one-form\n $$\\alpha_j:=\\iota_{X_j}\\omega_{\\mathbb C}=\\sum_{k=1}^d u^{(j)}_k\\,dw_k-\\sum_{k=1}^d v^{(j)}_k\\,dz^k$$\n is closed there.\n3. There is a holomorphic $H_j:D_j\\to\\mathbb C$ with $dH_j=\\alpha_j$, $H_j(0)=0$ and $H_j$ real-valued on $D_j\\cap\\mathbb R^{2d}$, and\n $$\\lvert\\nabla H_j\\rvert\\le\\sqrt{2d}\\,\\beta_j,\\qquad \\lvert H_j(Z)\\rvert\\le\\sqrt{2d}\\,\\beta_j\\,\\lvert Z\\rvert\\qquad(Z\\in D_j).$$\n4. $X_1=X_{\\tilde H}=J\\nabla\\tilde H$; that is, for every holomorphic $f$ on the domain of $X_1$, $X_1f=d\\!f(X_{\\tilde H})$.",
          "inventory_expansion_required": false
        },
