          "reference": "analytic-backward-error.md#e29",
          "design_state": "Fully authored draft; outside artifact completion cycle 1; independent native review remains pending",
          "statement": "Use the splitting data, constants and $N(h),H_h$ of [[lem-cm-optimal-truncation-gives-exponential-local-defect]]. There are constants $C_E,C_G<\\infty$, independent of $0<h\\le a/3$, such that on $D(\\rho/8)$\n\n$$|H_h-\\tilde H|\\le C_Eh^2,\\qquad \\|\\nabla H_h\\|\\le C_G.$$\n\nIn particular $H_h$ is real analytic on the real part. Its additive normalization is $H_h(0)=H(0)$, so the comparison includes constants.",
