                "title": "Rick Durrett, Probability: Theory and Examples, 5th ed., Section 2.2.1: finite variance sum and Chebyshev argument",
                "url": "https://sites.math.duke.edu/~rtd/PTE/PTE5_011119.pdf"
              }
            ]
          }
