          "id": "def-stable-unstable-cones-and-line-slopes",
          "kind": "definition",
          "title": "Stable and unstable cones, invariant line slopes, stable and unstable sets, and transverse homoclinic points of the quadratic family",
          "dependency_level": 0,
          "deps": [
