          "id": "def-smooth-periodic-oscillator-pulse-model",
          "kind": "definition",
          "title": "The smooth $P$-periodic pulsed oscillator: the normalized pulse, its Hamiltonian and its stroboscopic (period) map",
          "dependency_level": 3,
