                "title": "G. Teschl, Ordinary Differential Equations and Dynamical Systems, AMS Graduate Studies in Mathematics 140 (author's preliminary online edition, complete PDF), Section 3.3, the linear planar oscillator and its rotation matrices",
                "url": "https://www.mat.univie.ac.at/~gerald/ftp/book-ode/ode.pdf"
