          "physical_scope": "A worked model check inside the framework: verification that three force maps of this page satisfy the standing continuity and state-local-Lipschitz hypotheses of the force postulate, with explicit constants where available; the uniform-force model has constant 0, the linear drag model has constant c, and the inverse-square external model is locally Lipschitz on each collision-free annulus with the stated constant and has no continuous extension to the excluded center. The item is a finite verification inside the adopted models; it asserts no motion, no measurement and no empirical claim.",
          "sources": {
