                "title": "I. W. Stewart, Advanced Classical Mechanics (MIT 8.09 Advanced Classical Mechanics, Fall 2014 course text), Chapter 2 Section 2.4, printed pages 41-48 (PDF pages 44-51): Euler equations and the linear treatment of rotational stability at a principal-axis spin",
                "url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/8-09-classical-mechanics-iii-fall-2014/d9bac33f6c60b304dc0398e99b327102_MIT8_09F14_full.pdf"
