          "physical_scope": "A worked generating-function computation for the declared one-label free-particle presentation: the explicit free Hamiltonian flow, its first-kind generating function $S_t$ with the mixed-Hessian determinant, the invertibility of the $(q,Q)$-projection for $t\\neq0$, the degeneration of the generating data at $t=0$, and the exact change of the canonical one-form along the flow. All quantities are model values of the declared idealization; no measurement is reported.",
          "sources": {
