              {
                "title": "D. Tong, Classical Dynamics (Cambridge lecture notes, January 2015 printing), Sections 4.4.3 and 4.7, printed pages 104-105 and 121-124 (PDF pages 110-111 and 127-130): generating functions and the free-particle action/complete integral used to generate the free flow",
