                "title": "I. Stewart, Advanced Classical Mechanics (MIT 8.09/8.309 Fall 2014 course text), Chapter 5, Sections 5.2-5.3, Eqs. (5.23)-(5.28), printed pages 96-98 (PDF pages 99-101): secular versus periodic first-order effects after averaging over one period, with no general convergence or remainder theorem",
                "url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/8-09-classical-mechanics-iii-fall-2014/d9bac33f6c60b304dc0398e99b327102_MIT8_09F14_full.pdf"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
