              },
              {
                "title": "Iain Stewart, Advanced Classical Mechanics (MIT 8.09/8.309, Fall 2014), Chapter 5 (perturbations) and Chapter 7 (stability and chaos), including the equilibrium, fixed-point and flow notions",
