                "title": "K. K. Likharev, Essential Graduate Physics, Part CM: Classical Mechanics (title page last edited September 1, 2026), Sections 1.1-1.2, chapter pages 1-3 (PDF pages 5-7): absolute time and Euclidean space, velocity and acceleration transfers between frames, and the absence of a speed restriction in the model",
