                "title": "G. Teschl, Mathematical Methods in Quantum Mechanics, 1st edition 2009, Section 2.7 pp. 84-85 (absolutely continuous and Sobolev representatives; the weak-derivative reduction is supplied by the exact mathematical dependencies)",
                "url": "https://www.mat.univie.ac.at/~gerald/ftp/book-schroe/schroe.pdf"
              },
              {
                "title": "Haim Brezis, Functional Analysis, Sobolev Spaces and Partial Differential Equations (Springer Universitext 2011), Section 8.2 pp. 204-210 (weak derivatives and absolutely continuous representatives in one dimension)",
                "url": "https://www.math.toronto.edu/almut/Brezis.pdf"
              }
            ]
          },
          "aliases": [
