                "title": "G. Teschl, Mathematical Methods in Quantum Mechanics, first edition 2009, Section 5.1, Theorem 5.1 and its complete proof, printed pp. 123-124 (PDF pp. 135-136): the autonomous self-adjoint unitary group, exact generator domain and domain invariance. The time-dependent gauge-transported propagator calculation is supplied locally.",
                "url": "https://www.mat.univie.ac.at/~gerald/ftp/book-schroe/schroe.pdf"
              },
