          "dependency_level": 8,
          "physical_scope": "The preparation and apparatus assumptions of the framework: a comparison with data requires declared preparation, isolation, detection and sampling models, repetitions are an additional statistical model, and the claim that an apparatus realizes a preparation and a dynamics is a physically tested identification with uncertainty. The item asserts no measured result, adopts no sampling distribution as a quantum law, and excludes inferred certainty about identification or about the model.",
