          "statement": "Apply the dimension conventions of [[def-nrqm-framework-quantities-and-units]] to the quantities of the framework: the time and space coordinates of an inertial frame of [[def-nrqm-framework-inertial-frames]], a position wave function of the one-particle model, the position and momentum operators and their canonical commutator of [[lem-nrqm-framework-ccr-on-the-schwartz-core]], the kinetic and potential terms of the Hamiltonian and the Schroedinger equation of [[post-nrqm-framework-nonrelativistic-kinematics-and-massive-particle]] and [[post-nrqm-framework-autonomous-dynamics]], the probability density and current of the continuity calculation, and the candidate phase exponent $mv\\cdot x/\\hbar$ if used in a separately specified boost model.",
