          "dependency_level": 9,
          "sources": {
            "references": [
              {
                "title": "J. Preskill, Lecture Notes for Ph219/CS219: Quantum Information, Chapter 2 (updated July 2015), Sections 2.2.1, 2.3.2 and 2.6, printed pages 8-9, 21-23 and 36-39 (Bloch-vector determination of qubit states; statistics distinguishing states and the trace-distance notion)",
