                "title": "B. Zwiebach, MIT 8.05 Quantum Physics II (Fall 2013), Chapter 7 'Two State Systems', Section 1, printed pages 1-6 (the two-state Hamiltonian with energies g_0 plus or minus g and its energy eigenstates)",
                "url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/8-05-quantum-physics-ii-fall-2013/7c376a3b5b27e5ea586a7e37b85a05d3_MIT8_05F13_Chap_07.pdf"
