          "dependency_level": 12,
          "sources": {
            "references": [
              {
                "title": "J. Preskill, Lecture Notes for Ph219/CS219: Quantum Information, Chapter 3 'Foundations II: Measurement and Evolution' (updated July 2015), Section 3.1.2, printed pages 9-11 (realising a POVM by entangling the system with a pointer and measuring the pointer; eqs. (3.23)-(3.31))",
