              {
                "title": "D. Tong, Quantum Mechanics (author-hosted lecture set), Section 3.3, printed pages 76-77 (the measurement postulate, collapse and its stated limits)",
                "url": "https://davidtong.org/pdfs/teaching/quantum-mechanics/qm.pdf"
              },
              {
                "title": "J. Binney and D. Skinner, The Physics of Quantum Mechanics, Sections 1.4 and 6.5, printed pages 15 and 132-135 (ideal measurement, and the discussion of apparatus dynamics versus collapse)",
                "url": "https://www-thphys.physics.ox.ac.uk/people/JamesBinney/qb.pdf"
