          "physical_scope": "A scope audit of the measurement-and-instruments page: it records that the page's measurement content is a conditional development of the adopted ideal conditional-measurement postulate P3 and its declared instruments, that no apparatus realization, outcome uniqueness, exact-continuum collapse or empirical result is asserted, and which measurement topics are deferred to later pages. The remark proves nothing and reports no observation."
