          "sources": {
            "references": [
              {
                "title": "J. Preskill, Lecture Notes for Ph219/CS219: Quantum Information, Chapter 3 'Foundations II: Measurement and Evolution' (updated July 2015), Section 3.1.2, printed pages 9-11 (generalized measurements, POVM effects, and the freedom of the post-measurement state)",
