        {
          "id": "lem-nrqm-autonomous-dynamics-flow-calculus",
          "kind": "lemma",
          "domain": "mathematics",
          "title": "Flow calculus of a self-adjoint generator: commutation, invariance and differentiability",
          "statement": "Assume the Axiom of Choice and the Axiom of Countable Choice ([[def-axiom-of-choice]], [[def-countable-choice]]), the choice hypotheses of the cited spectral and functional-calculus suppliers. Let $H\\ne\\{0\\}$ be a complex Hilbert space ([[def-hilbert-space]]), let $T$ be self-adjoint on $H$ ([[def-symmetric-self-adjoint-and-essentially-self-adjoint]]) with spectral projection-valued measure $E$ ([[thm-spectral-theorem-for-unbounded-self-adjoint-operators]], [[def-projection-valued-measure]]), and put\n$$U(t):=e^{itT}=\\int_{\\mathbb R}e^{it\\lambda}\\,dE(\\lambda)\\qquad(t\\in\\mathbb R)$$\nin the sense of the integral of a measurable function against a projection-valued measure ([[def-unbounded-integral-against-a-pvm]]). Then:\n\n(a) $U$ is a strongly continuous one-parameter unitary group ([[def-strongly-continuous-one-parameter-unitary-group]]) with $U(0)=I$, $U(t+s)=U(t)U(s)$ and $U(t)^{*}=U(t)^{-1}=U(-t)$ for all $s,t$; moreover $U(t)D(T)=D(T)$, $TU(t)=U(t)T$ on $D(T)$, and the difference quotient $\\frac1t\\bigl(U(t)x-x\\bigr)$ has a norm limit as $t\\to0$ exactly for $x\\in D(T)$, where that limit is $iTx$ ([[lem-self-adjoint-operator-generates-a-strongly-continuous-unitary-group]], [[def-infinitesimal-generator-of-a-unitary-group]]).\n\n(b) For every bounded Borel function $h:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb C$ and every $t\\in\\mathbb R$ one has $h(T)U(t)=U(t)h(T)$; in particular $E(B)U(t)=U(t)E(B)$ for every Borel set $B\\subseteq\\mathbb R$.\n\n(c) For $x\\in D(T)$ the map $t\\mapsto U(t)x$ is differentiable at every $t\\in\\mathbb R$, with\n$$\\frac{d}{dt}U(t)x=iU(t)Tx=iTU(t)x;$$\nfor $x\\in H\\setminus D(T)$ the map $t\\mapsto U(t)x$ is differentiable at no point of $\\mathbb R$.",
          "strategy": "direct",
          "deps": [
            "def-axiom-of-choice",
            "def-countable-choice",
            "def-hilbert-space",
            "def-infinitesimal-generator-of-a-unitary-group",
            "def-projection-valued-measure",
            "def-strongly-continuous-one-parameter-unitary-group",
            "def-symmetric-self-adjoint-and-essentially-self-adjoint",
            "def-unbounded-integral-against-a-pvm",
            "lem-self-adjoint-operator-generates-a-strongly-continuous-unitary-group",
            "thm-bounded-borel-pvm-integral",
            "thm-pvm-integral-is-a-star-homomorphism",
            "thm-spectral-theorem-for-unbounded-self-adjoint-operators",
            "thm-unbounded-borel-functional-calculus"
          ],
          "dependency_roles": {
