                "url": "https://www.mat.univie.ac.at/~gerald/ftp/book-schroe/schroe.pdf"
              },
              {
                "title": "B. Zwiebach, MIT 8.05 Quantum Physics II (Fall 2013), Chapter 6 'Quantum Dynamics', Sections 2.1-3.2, printed pages 10-22 (unitary time evolution, the evolution operator, Heisenberg operators and the Heisenberg equation)",
                "url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/8-05-quantum-physics-ii-fall-2013/79a8091ef4f18d8e3ff76a097e8db33c_MIT8_05F13_Chap_06.pdf"
              },
