          "statement": "Adopt the autonomous-dynamics reading of the framework ([[def-nrqm-autonomous-dynamics-framework-evolution]], [[post-nrqm-framework-autonomous-dynamics|P4]]). Then: **every** preparation of an isolated system that is a superposition of two or more energy eigenrays with distinct eigenvalues is a stationary state, in the sense that all of its outcome laws are independent of time; in particular a superposition of two eigenrays of the two-level model is stationary.",
