          "physical_scope": "An exact model computation for the spin-0 massive particle model of the framework: a normalized three-dimensional Gaussian wave function, its unitary momentum representative with the transposed width sigma_p=hbar/sigma, the resulting position and momentum outcome densities, their variances and the product hbar/2 in this single family of preparations. The item uses the model's own sharp outcome laws; it computes no dynamics, models no measurement, asserts no uncertainty theorem for arbitrary preparations and records no empirical result."
