          "physical_scope": "Scope of the two-path preparation and detection page: the declared preparation and detector models, the coherent and which-path detection laws with phase-zero admissibility qualifications, the recorded-bin, loss and conditioning laws, continuity and local balance for regular solutions under the bounded measurable P5 potential, interval-scoped global conservation under explicit hypotheses, and the finite-sampling thought experiment. The remark asserts no experiment, records no counts or uncertainties, and makes no claim about nature."
