                "title": "D. Tong, Quantum Mechanics (author-hosted lecture set), Sections 3.4 and 3.4.1, printed pages 81-88 (PDF pages 84-91): canonical commutation relations, the position-momentum bound Delta x Delta p >= hbar/2 and the Gaussian saturation",
