                "title": "G. Teschl, Mathematical Methods in Quantum Mechanics, 1st edition 2009, Section 2.1 and Section 8.1, printed pages 55-58 and 173-175 (PDF pages 67-70 and 185-187): position and momentum as self-adjoint operators and the algebraic calculus behind the canonical commutation relation",
