                "url": "https://www.mat.univie.ac.at/~gerald/ftp/book-schroe/schroe.pdf"
              }
            ]
          },
          "physical_scope": "A scope audit of the uncertainty and compatibility page: it records P1 and P2 in the framework's vocabulary, the P5/P6 model assignments used for position and momentum, and P3 solely for the compatible-observables item's stipulated ideal finite-bin Lüders updates on positive-probability outcomes. The page proves conditional preparation-spread inequalities and spectral-compatibility criteria; it rules out only a joint sharp position-momentum observable with the exact spectral marginals and makes no claim about unsharp joint laws. It asserts no universal disturbance relation or concrete-apparatus disturbance claim, dynamics, empirical value or experimental finding. It proves nothing itself and reports no observation."
        }
      ],
