          "physical_scope": "Finite checks in the declared Dirichlet interval model of the pair: the free box eigenpairs, their explicit nodal points, the exact spectrum under a constant potential shift, the attainment of the min-max bound and the eigenvalue gaps. The example is an exact conditional computation in the declared confined model; it asserts no material wall, no measured spectrum and no empirical result."
