                "title": "D. Tong, Quantum Mechanics (author-hosted lecture set), Chapter 2, printed pages 19-63 (PDF pages 22-66): one-dimensional potentials, wells, barriers and tunnelling",
                "url": "https://davidtong.org/pdfs/teaching/quantum-mechanics/qm.pdf"
              },
