          "strategy": "direct",
          "physical_scope": "The preparation spreads of position and momentum in the coherent states of the one-dimensional oscillator model, the exact value hbar/2 of their product, the one-dimensional position-momentum relation Delta Q Delta P >= hbar/2 for every unit preparation vector in the common domain of the two model operators, and the saturation of that relation by every coherent preparation. The statement is a conditional consequence of the postulates P1, P2 and P5, of the adopted oscillator model, of the cited uncertainty and moment results and of the cited mathematics; it concerns the two separately assigned outcome laws in one preparation and asserts no joint outcome law, no apparatus resolution, no disturbance and no empirical result."
