                "title": "B. Zwiebach, MIT 8.05 Quantum Physics II (Fall 2013), Chapter 6 'Quantum Dynamics', §1 printed pages 1-9: the ladder relations a|n> = sqrt(n)|n-1> and a^dagger|n> = sqrt(n+1)|n+1> and the number operator",
                "url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/8-05-quantum-physics-ii-fall-2013/79a8091ef4f18d8e3ff76a097e8db33c_MIT8_05F13_Chap_06.pdf"
