          "dependency_level": 11,
          "physical_scope": "The gauge structure of the prescribed-coupling model P5a for a spinless particle with admissible bounded-coefficient potentials: the conjugation identity transporting the minimal-coupling operator to the gauge-transformed potentials, the exact criterion under which the gauge multiplier is a symmetry of the fixed declared dynamics, the global-phase case, and the unitary equivalence of the transformed time-dependent model carrying the transported propagator. The item is conditional on the postulates and the cited operator analysis; it asserts no Maxwell equation, no physical identification of gauges, no claim about nonconstant gauges beyond the displayed operator criterion, and no apparatus or empirical content.",
          "sources": {
