                "title": "G. Teschl, Mathematical Methods in Quantum Mechanics, 1st edition 2009, Sections 8.1-8.2, printed pages 173-178 (PDF pages 185-190): position and momentum, angular momentum, the rotation group generated by the orbital generators and the simultaneous eigenbasis theorem",
