                "title": "J. Binney and D. Skinner, The Physics of Quantum Mechanics, Section 6.1, printed pages 105-111 (PDF pages 113-119): composite systems, product and non-product states, and the definition of entanglement",
                "url": "https://www-thphys.physics.ox.ac.uk/people/JamesBinney/qb.pdf"
              },
