          "sources": {
            "references": [
              {
                "title": "J. Binney and D. Skinner, The Physics of Quantum Mechanics, Section 6.1, printed pages 105-111 (PDF pages 113-119): composite systems, the tensor product of two state spaces and operators acting on one factor alone",
