              {
                "title": "J. Binney and D. Skinner, The Physics of Quantum Mechanics, Section 6.1.4, printed pages 111-115 (PDF pages 119-123): the predictions of one observer's measurements are unaffected by the other observer's choice of measurement direction",
                "url": "https://www-thphys.physics.ox.ac.uk/people/JamesBinney/qb.pdf"
              },
              {
                "title": "B. Zwiebach, MIT 8.05 Quantum Physics II (Fall 2013), Chapter 8 'Multiparticle States and Tensor Products', Sections 2-3, chapter pages 8-12: partial measurement of one particle of an entangled pair and the resulting description of the other factor",
                "url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/8-05-quantum-physics-ii-fall-2013/ffe665c0cba2eae19a83e88dec42925c_MIT8_05F13_Chap_08.pdf"
