          "physical_scope": "An exact comparison in the declared framework between the reduced preparation of the two-factor spin singlet and a fair classical randomization of the two spin-up and spin-down preparations of one factor: the two density operators coincide, the composite descriptions differ, and the joint directional correlations distinguish them. The example asserts no measured correlation, no experiment and no empirical fact, and it makes no claim about any interpretation of the mixture."
