          "physical_scope": "The declared model vocabulary of a two-station spin comparison inside the framework: two declared spin-half internal factors, a declared composite preparation, two declared unit directions per station, the four declared joint sign measurements with their outcome laws, the correlation table and the CHSH functional, and the class of local-response models of that table. The definition adds no physical assumption beyond P1, P2, P3, P5, P6 and P7 in their stated readings; P5 is inherited through the massive spin-s model and the spin-spectrum supplier, with only their internal-factor content used here. It assigns no spatial position, worldline, separation or temporal order to the factors, asserts no dynamics, no apparatus realization, no measured correlation and no empirical fact, and leaves the identification of a laboratory arrangement with these declarations to the tested identification of P7."
