                "title": "F. H. L. Essler, Advanced Quantum Theory (Oxford lecture notes, 2017/18), Chapter 1 Sections 1.2-1.3 pp. 5-9: occupation-number states, the two sectors and the exclusion of repeated fermionic occupations",
