                "title": "J. Binney and D. Skinner, The Physics of Quantum Mechanics, Section 10.1 printed pages 226-230 (PDF pages 234-238): exchange symmetry and exclusion as physical input and deduction, and the empirical status of the boson/fermion assignment",
                "url": "https://www-thphys.physics.ox.ac.uk/people/JamesBinney/qb.pdf"
