          "physical_scope": "The variational and min-max statements of the declared trial model: every trial value is at least the model bottom E0, a trial value within epsilon of an isolated bottom with gap g forces ground-projection content at least 1 - epsilon/g, and the model's discrete eigenvalues below the essential spectrum are exactly the min-max values over trial subspaces of the form domain. All quantities are readings of the declared operator; no measurement, apparatus, sampling model or laboratory identification is asserted.",
