                "title": "J. Binney and D. Skinner, The Physics of Quantum Mechanics, Section 9.1 printed pages 203-205 (PDF pages 211-213): the perturbative expansions (9.2)-(9.11), the first-order shift E_b = <E0|Delta|E0> (9.6) and the second-order shift (9.11), derived under the non-degeneracy assumption",
                "url": "https://www-thphys.physics.ox.ac.uk/people/JamesBinney/qb.pdf"
