              {
                "title": "G. Teschl, Mathematical Methods in Quantum Mechanics, 1st edition 2009, Section 6.6 printed pages 153-159 (PDF pages 165-171): strong and norm resolvent convergence and the analytic perturbation consequences for bounded perturbations",
