          "physical_scope": "The finite-interval WKB error statement for the declared WKB regime model: on a closed interval on which the dimensionless potential stays strictly below the energy (no turning point), any exact solution of the model equation is compared with its leading WKB wave, with the explicit Gronwall-type error bound of the cited theorem. The statement is exact at each value of the semiclassical parameter; it asserts no asymptotic connection across a turning point, no barrier transmission formula, no wave packet and no measurement.",
          "empirical_premises": []
