          "physical_scope": "A conditional two-level computation inside the declared perturbed-family model with a finite gap: the exact eigenvalues of the family, its second-order coefficient, the exact quartic expansion, and a finite numerical check of the page's cubic remainder bound at half the perturbation radius. The example is a model computation in the declared finite-dimensional subspace; it asserts no physical system identification, no measured splitting and no transition."
