          "physical_scope": "The declared circular two-level drive model with splitting frequency omega0, transverse coupling Omega1 and drive frequency omega: the exact rotating-frame reduction to the constant matrix (hbar/2)(Delta sigma_z + Omega1 sigma_x), the exact level populations of the evolved up-state as Rabi probabilities, the resonance case and the pi-pulse and return times. The statement is exact for the declared finite model; it asserts no damping or relaxation, no measurement record, no laboratory identification of the parameters and no empirical result.",
          "empirical_premises": []
