              {
                "title": "J. Binney and D. Skinner, The Physics of Quantum Mechanics, Section 9.1.2 printed pages 206-208 (PDF pages 214-216): the behaviour of a gapped level under a slowly applied perturbation",
                "url": "https://www-thphys.physics.ox.ac.uk/people/JamesBinney/qb.pdf"
