              {
                "title": "J. Binney and D. Skinner, The Physics of Quantum Mechanics, Section 8.1 printed pages 181-200 (PDF pages 189-208): the hydrogenic spectrum E_n = -K/(2 a0 n^2) and the n^2 degeneracy of the level n",
