          "physical_scope": "A conditional computation inside the declared circular two-level drive model with declared dimensionless angular-frequency ratios: the exact Rabi populations at a quarter-inversion time, at the pi-pulse and at the return time, and a detuned finite check, together with the periodicity of the population. The example is a model computation; it asserts no laboratory system, no measured frequency, no damping and no measurement record."
