                "title": "B. Zwiebach, MIT 8.05 Quantum Physics II (Fall 2013), Chapter 7 'Two State Systems', Section 5 chapter pages 14-15 (PDF pages 14-15): the linearly oscillating ammonia drive and the counter-rotating terms of the decomposition",
