          "physical_scope": "A conditional computation inside the declared linear two-level drive model with declared dimensionless angular-frequency ratios: the rotating-wave error budget at three elapsed times, one exact rational averaged Rabi population, and the comparison with the exactly solvable circular drive. The example is a model computation; it asserts no laboratory system, no measured frequency or population, no damping and no measurement record."
