          "physical_scope": "The declared short-range scattering model with a real bounded central compactly supported potential in the pair's stationary elastic beam reading: rotational reduction of the amplitude to a function of the scattering angle, its convergent Legendre expansion, the unit-modulus channel factors, the phase shift read modulo pi, and the total cross section as a convergent phase-shift series in m^2. Conditional on the declared model and the cited mathematics; no measured angular distribution, no low-energy extrapolation beyond the stated series and no channel identification for material systems is asserted."
