            "references": [
              {
                "title": "F. H. L. Essler, Advanced Quantum Theory (Oxford lecture notes, 2017/18), Sections 1.1-1.2 and 1.4 pp. 3-13: independent-particle eigenstates as tensor products, occupation-number configurations, Fock-space sectors and the second-quantised form of one-body operators",
