          "physical_scope": "The reading of the radiation extension postulate in the framework's vocabulary: the transverse one-particle space, the bosonic Fock sector assignment, the vocabulary of modes and mode families, normalized one-photon wave-packet coordinates f(k) in m^(3/2) under d^3k and dimensionless coherent-state labels z, the assigned total-number observable in the dimensionless unit 1, the assigned free-field energy observable in joules with epsilon(k)=hbar*c*|k|, and the assigned total momentum components and their one-photon restrictions in kg m s^-1 with the mode assignments omega=c|k|, E=hbar*omega and p=hbar*k. The readings record operator domains and self-adjointness from the cited mathematics; they assert no detector response, no light-matter coupling, no dynamics, no Lorentz transformation law and no empirical result.",
