          "physical_scope": "A finite-dimensional model comparison on the declared fixed propagation-mode polarisation space: the Born probability cos^2(theta) of the quantised model's ideal analyser for the preparation along e_1, and the dimensionless relative-intensity ratio cos^2(theta) of a declared normalized classical transverse complex amplitude passed through the same projection. The example establishes that the two declared models agree on this ratio and asserts no field quantisation, no detector claim, no Maxwell derivation and no empirical result.",
