          },
          "physical_scope": "The scope of the photons and radiation modes examples page: what the three conditional model comparisons establish, the idealised model assignments and declared parameters they rest on, and the empirical, apparatus and statistical claims they do not make.",
          "sources": {
            "references": [
              {
                "title": "J. Binney and D. Skinner, The Physics of Quantum Mechanics, Section 1.3.6 printed pages 14-15 (PDF pages 22-23): quantum and classical polarisation ratios, individual photons passed or absorbed, and the explicit agreement with the classical description",
                "url": "https://www-thphys.physics.ox.ac.uk/people/JamesBinney/qb.pdf"
              },
