        {
          "id": "cex-sr-born-rigid-motion-need-not-be-killing",
          "kind": "counterexample",
          "domain": "mathematics",
          "title": "Counterexample: a Born-rigid congruence need not be a Killing congruence",
          "statement": "**False claim:** every smooth Born-rigid future unit timelike field $n$ ([[def-sr-observer-congruence-and-kinematics]], [[def-sr-chart-tetrad-and-congruence-distinction]]) is locally a positive multiple of a Killing field: there is a positive smooth function $f$ on a neighbourhood of every point with $\\mathcal L_{fn}\\eta=0$ ([[thm-sr-smooth-local-herglotz-noether]]).",
          "strategy": "The hyperbolic identities give an orthonormal pair (e_0,e_1), with e_0'=k e_1 and e_1'=k e_0. The FTC defines z'=e_0. Differentiating Phi gives partial_lambda Phi=N e_0, partial_xi Phi=e_1 and the constant transverse vectors; at0 the derivative is invertible, so the choice-free smooth inverse-function theorem gives an injective local chart. Shrink to a coordinate box with |lambda|,|xi|<epsilon L_0 and epsilon<1 to ensure N>=1-epsilon^2>0. The metric follows directly; its rest-slice metric is lambda-independent, so theta=0, and its rest distribution is the lambda foliation, so omega=0. Its Christoffel/flat-coordinate derivative gives a=(k/N)partial_xi, hence a-flat=(k/N)d xi. Differentiate k/(1+k xi) in lambda: k'/N^2=1/(L_0^2N^2), proving the displayed nonclosed acceleration form. For Born-rigid n, sym nabla n=-n-flat sym-tensor a-flat. The equation L_{f n}eta=0 is n-flat sym-tensor(df-f a-flat)=0; evaluation twice on n and once on n plus a rest vector forces df-f a-flat=0, hence d log f=a-flat. Applying d and the exterior-square-zero theorem contradicts the everywhere nonzero displayed two-form. This replaces the false Rindler counterexample while preserving the full intended claim. Its explicit local construction has no global quotient, tube completeness or material-model assumption, and uses no choice principle. The nonlogical Rindler clarification is checked directly from the A theorem: its metric −rho^2 dtheta^2+drho^2+dy^2+dz^2 is theta-independent, hence partial_theta is Killing and rho n=partial_theta. It is not an example premise.",
