              {
                "title": "A. Einstein, 'Zur Elektrodynamik bewegter Koerper', Annalen der Physik 322 (10) 891-921 (1905), Section 7 'Theorie des Dopplerschen Prinzips und der Aberration', journal pp. 910-912: transformed wave phase and frequency nu' = nu (1 - cos(phi) v/V)/sqrt(1-(v/V)^2), the longitudinal special case nu' = nu sqrt((1-v/V)/(1+v/V)) and the aberration law cos(phi') = (cos(phi)-v/V)/(1-(v/V)cos(phi)); proofread transcription of the original at German Wikisource",
