          "physical_scope": "Worked comparison of the two transverse Doppler protocols of the ideal plane-wave model at relative speed (3/5)c: gamma in the frame where the wave is transverse to the motion and 1/gamma in the frame where it is transverse in the observer's frame. Conditional on the model; no measurement, statistical inference or empirical claim.",
