          "physical_scope": "Isolated systems in flat affine Minkowski spacetime on finite axis-parallel slices of one inertial chart, with total stress-energy satisfying either the adopted model equations or an explicit conservation premise and vanishing side flux. Excludes arbitrary or boosted hypersurfaces, four-vector transformation of the chart integral, noncompact and asymptotic charges, gravity and all measurement claims."
