      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ex-gr-flat-space-geodesics-and-proper-time",
          "kind": "example",
          "domain": "mathematics",
          "title": "Geodesics, proper time and parallel transport of the flat model",
          "statement": "Let $M=\\mathbb R^4$ carry the identity chart $x=(x^0,x^1,x^2,x^3)$, the flat\nLorentzian metric $g=\\operatorname{diag}(-1,1,1,1)$ and the time orientation\n$N=\\partial_0$, so that $(M,g,N)$ is a time-oriented smooth Lorentzian\nfour-manifold ([[def-gr-smooth-lorentzian-objects]]). Then:\n\n1. The coordinate connection $\\nabla$ with $\\Gamma^a{}_{bc}=0$ in the identity\n   chart is the metric-selected connection of $g$, and its geodesics are\n   exactly the affine lines $t\\mapsto p+tv$.\n2. For a future timelike geodesic with tangent $v$, the proper-time increment over\n   $[t_0,t]$ is $\\sqrt{-g(v,v)}\\,(t-t_0)/c$; in particular the future timelike\n   geodesic through $p$ with four-velocity $u$ is\n   $\\tau\\mapsto p+\\tau u$, and its four-velocity $u$ has $g(u,u)=-c^2$.\n3. Parallel transport by $\\nabla$ along any piecewise smooth curve preserves\n   the components in the identity chart: $D_tV=0$ if and only if $V$ has\n   constant components; hence transport is a $g$-isometry, and the transported\n   vector depends only on the endpoints.\n4. The exponential map is $\\exp_p(v)=p+v$ on all of $T_pM$, with\n   $d(\\exp_p)_0=\\operatorname{id}$, and the identity chart translated to $p$\n   gives $g_{ab}(p)=\\eta_{ab}$, $\\partial_ag_{bc}(p)=0$ exactly (not merely at\n   first order).",
          "strategy": "On flat R^4 with the trivial coordinate connection, verify metric compatibility and torsion freedom to identify the metric-selected connection, then compute its geodesics, proper-time increments, parallel transport and exponential map explicitly.",
          "deps": [
            "def-gr-smooth-lorentzian-objects",
            "def-gr-metric-selected-connection",
            "thm-gr-nondegenerate-levi-civita-and-tensor-derivative",
            "thm-gr-local-geodesics-and-exponential-map",
            "lem-gr-parallel-transport-and-geodesic-speed",
            "def-gr-timelike-worldline-and-proper-time",
            "lem-gr-proper-time-reparametrization-and-four-velocity",
            "def-geodesic-of-an-affine-connection",
            "def-parallel-section-along-a-curve",
            "thm-covariant-derivative-along-a-curve-is-independent-of-frame-and-extension",
            "def-christoffel-symbols-of-an-affine-connection",
            "prop-coordinate-geodesic-equation"
          ],
          "dependency_roles": {
            "def-gr-smooth-lorentzian-objects": "mathematical-premise",
            "def-gr-metric-selected-connection": "mathematical-premise",
            "thm-gr-nondegenerate-levi-civita-and-tensor-derivative": "mathematical-premise",
            "thm-gr-local-geodesics-and-exponential-map": "mathematical-premise",
            "lem-gr-parallel-transport-and-geodesic-speed": "mathematical-premise",
            "def-gr-timelike-worldline-and-proper-time": "mathematical-premise",
            "lem-gr-proper-time-reparametrization-and-four-velocity": "mathematical-premise",
            "def-geodesic-of-an-affine-connection": "mathematical-premise",
