          "physical_scope": "An exact flat-space instance of the framework's Killing energy: a constant static dust with the length-normalized translation Killing field of the identity chart, the current three-form of its Killing current, the value of the Killing energy on three-chains carried by constant-time slices, and its conservation up to the side flux. The example is an exact model calculation under the framework's unit reading; it asserts no measured value and no empirical mass, and the identification of its numbers with any physical energy requires separate empirical premises.",
