                "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1309.7591"
              },
              {
                "title": "P. T. Chrusciel, Elements of causality theory, arXiv:1110.6706 (2011): causal convexity and the elementary regions of Theorem 2.9.9, printed pp. 46-50",
