                "url": "https://courses.physics.ucsd.edu/2025/Spring/physics210a/LECTURES/STATMECH.pdf"
              }
            ]
          },
          "library": "physics",
          "physical_scope": "A hypothetical closed two-site quantum model initialized in a product energy eigenstate; unitary evolution preserves that state and does not produce its finite-temperature Gibbs mixture. This is not an experiment.",
