          "inventory_expansion_required": false,
          "statement": "Let $M,R\\in\\{0,1\\}$ have joint probabilities $p(0,0)=p(1,1)=1/2$ and $p(0,1)=p(1,0)=0$. Then $H(M)=H(R)=\\log2$, $H(M,R)=\\log2$, $H(M|R)=0$, and $I(M;R)=\\log2$.",
