                "locator": "§7.1, printed pp. 168-170, formulas (7.10)-(7.13): the source term is $\\int_0^t(t-s)\\frac{1}{4\\pi}\\int_{S^2}f(s,x+(t-s)\\omega)d\\sigma_2(\\omega)ds$, the expression specialised in clauses (i) and (ii)"
