                "title": "David Tong, Electromagnetism, University of Cambridge Part II Mathematical Tripos lecture notes (2026 printing)",
                "url": "https://www.damtp.cam.ac.uk/user/tong/em/electro.pdf",
                "locator": "§6.1, printed pp. 134-135: the gauge potential $A^\\mu=(\\phi/c,-A)$, the gauge transformation $A^\\mu\\to A^\\mu+\\partial^\\mu\\chi$, the Lorenz gauge condition $\\partial_\\mu A^\\mu=0$ and the identity $\\Box=(1/c^2)\\partial^2/\\partial t^2-\\nabla^2$; §6.4.3, printed p. 161: the field conventions $E=-\\nabla\\phi-\\partial A/\\partial t$ and $B=\\nabla\\times A$ with $\\kappa=1-\\hat R\\cdot v/c$"
              },
              {
