          "domain": "mathematics",
          "title": "Explicit checks of the retarded kernel, the static Liénard-Wiechert specialization and an explicit Lorenz-gauge transformation",
          "reference": "batch-21-local-construction (see research/physics-em-sr-40-2026-10-08-batch-21.notes.md); the design reserves no example for this B page, and this example checks lem-em-retarded-wave-kernel(a), lem-em-gauge-wave-reachability(b)-(c) and lem-em-point-retarded-potential-and-fields(c) in explicit instances",
          "design_state": "scaffolder-constructed-explicit-mathematical-example; recorded in the batch notes",
          "dependency_level": 5,
          "deps": [
            "lem-em-point-retarded-potential-and-fields",
