                "locator": "Section 2.4.1-2.4.4 printed pp. 90-96: the work done to move a charge and the assembly of point charges (pp. 90-93), the continuous-distribution identities W = (1/2) integral rho V and W = (epsilon_0/2) integral E^2 (Eqs. (2.43) and (2.45), pp. 93-95), and the comment that the point-charge field energy is infinite while the assembly expression omits self-terms (pp. 95-96). Read in the stamped scanned full text, OCR cross-checked."
