                "locator": "Section 2.2.3 printed pp. 70-76 (Example 2.3 and the infinite-line example: cylinder Gaussian surface, flux and the 1/r field) and Section 2.3.2 printed pp. 79-83 (comments on the potential's reference point and the line-charge potential). Read in the stamped scanned full text, OCR cross-checked."
