                "locator": "Section 3.1.2 printed pp. 43-46 (the discontinuity $B_{\\rm above}-B_{\\rm below}=\\mu_0K$ at a surface current and the solenoid $B=\\mu_0IN\\hat z$); read in the stamped 236-page PDF."
              },
