                "locator": "§7.3.5 printed pp. 328-331, equations (7.49)-(7.55): the separation $\\rho=\\rho_f+\\rho_b$, $\\mathbf J=\\mathbf J_f+\\mathbf J_b+\\mathbf J_p$ with $\\rho_b=-\\nabla\\cdot\\mathbf P$, $\\mathbf J_b=\\nabla\\times\\mathbf M$, $\\mathbf J_p=\\partial\\mathbf P/\\partial t$, the resulting $\\mathbf D=\\epsilon_0\\mathbf E+\\mathbf P$ and the Maxwell equations in matter. Read in the stamped 596-page scan."
