                "locator": "§9.3.1 printed pp. 382-383: Maxwell's equations in a linear medium, the transcription $v=1/\\sqrt{\\varepsilon\\mu}$, the energy density (9.71), the Poynting vector (9.72) and the intensity (9.73); §9.3.3 printed pp. 387-388, Eqs. (9.89)-(9.94): $B=\\frac1v(k\\times E)$ and the exponential-factor matching; §9.4.1 printed pp. 393-396: the attenuated plane waves (9.123)-(9.138), transversality, the complex wave number (9.124), the magnetic amplitude relation (9.131) and the phase lag (9.135)-(9.136). Retained 596-page scan with OCR noise; the displayed relations were cross-checked against Tong and the local computations in the batch notes."
