          "physical_scope": "Conditional vector scattering of a smooth frequency-$\\omega$ source-free vacuum phasor pair by a smooth bounded stationary perfect electric conductor with connected exterior: the scattered and total phasor pairs, the associated real fields solving the zero-source smooth vacuum Maxwell equations on the exterior, the ideal PEC boundary condition $n\\times E_{\\rm tot}=0$, and uniqueness of the outgoing scattered solution with the prescribed tangential trace. Excluded: lossy, impedance, nonsmooth or dispersive obstacles; determination of induced surface charge or current; radiation-zone amplitude asymptotics beyond the outgoing modal class; singular or point sources; finite-energy, coupled self-force and every empirical claim.",
