          "title": "Straight timelike free particle",
          "statement": "In the affine Minkowski model $(A,V,\\eta,C^+)$, let $p\\in A$, let $U_0\\in V$ be future timelike with $\\eta(U_0,U_0)=-c^2$, and let $m>0$. The curve $x:\\mathbb R\\to A$, $x(\\tau)=p+\\tau U_0$, is a straight free massive trajectory.",
