        "distributions-integral-manifolds-and-the-frobenius-theorem",
        "geodesics-the-exponential-map-completeness-and-hopf-rinow",
        "hamiltonian-mechanics-and-completely-integrable-systems",
        "rank-theorems-and-embedded-submanifolds",
